        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christmas is coming! That means it’s time to dive into the holiday spirit with the new game Find All Things: Christmas. This time, you’ll explore a variety of themed locations filled with Christmas magic and an even wider selection of mini-games. Set up a cozy festive room or head to Santa’s workshop to help the elves assemble toys — there’s something for everyone! Play mini-games, search for hidden objects, beat match-3 levels, complete puzzles, and solve riddles — all in one game! For every level you complete, you’ll earn coins that you can use to unlock collectible items for your room. In this game, everyone will find something they enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948410/extras/e61c9d395dbd1f6c4b9e6f48f4bdbd3d.poster.avif?t=1783457584\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948410/extras/e61c9d395dbd1f6c4b9e6f48f4bdbd3d.webm?t=1783457584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948410/extras/e61c9d395dbd1f6c4b9e6f48f4bdbd3d.mp4?t=1783457584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an exciting journey with a variety of mini-games and puzzles that will never let you get bored.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Play 80 different levels in 20 themed locations<br>✔ Find hidden objects and match pairs<br>✔ Relax and unwind with soothing gameplay<br>✔ Build puzzles and solve various brain teasers<br>✔ Decorate the room with collectibles<br>✔ Discover tons of great desktop wallpapers<br>✔ Listen to game tunes in the music player</p>",
